        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho n’Imana ifūha kandi ni we ahōra; Uhoraho arahōra kandi yuzuye uburake; Uhoraho yihōra abarwanizi biwe, kand’ abansi biwe ababīkira uburake. ",
