              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho ateba kuraka, kand’ afise ububasha bginshi, ntatsindanishiriza na gatoya abo gutsindwa; inzira y’Uhoraho ica mu gashururu no mu kirura, kand’ ibicu ni wo mukungugu utumurwa n’ibirenge vyiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
